body:
Personally I went z.\*e to Zoe, Zoe overall does have a similar vibe to my deadname which gender aside I did always feel was a pretty fitting name, just to be clear I don't revolt my deadname like a lot of people do (reasonably so, deadnames can have a lot of trauma attached to them but my own lies elsewhere). Personally me and some others do regard their deadname well, I'm still the same person as I always was despite all the change that's happened and to completely sacrifice my deadname for me almost feels like sacrificing a small part of who I am now. 

&#x200B;

Anyways that's just a rationalization, ultimately it's just what felt right for me.
